mat=1000w\" width=\"1382\" height=\"1457\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/8f956c98-ed82-4221-a899-2fd6542d7fc8/key+4.png?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/8f956c98-ed82-4221-a899-2fd6542d7fc8/key+4.png?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/8f956c98-ed82-4221-a899-2fd6542d7fc8/key+4.png?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/8f956c98-ed82-4221-a899-2fd6542d7fc8/key+4.png?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/8f956c98-ed82-4221-a899-2fd6542d7fc8/key+4.png?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/8f956c98-ed82-4221-a899-2fd6542d7fc8/key+4.png?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/8f956c98-ed82-4221-a899-2fd6542d7fc8/key+4.png?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\n            \n          \n        \n          \n        \n\n        \n      \n        </figure>\n      \n\n    \n  \n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n    \n  \n    \n\n      \n\n      \n        <figure>\n          \n        \n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n          \n            \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/4c0eed77-e512-4c57-a3ba-c44de2922279/key+5.png?format=1000w\" width=\"1362\" height=\"1361\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/4c0eed77-e512-4c57-a3ba-c44de2922279/key+5.png?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/4c0eed77-e512-4c57-a3ba-c44de2922279/key+5.png?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/4c0eed77-e512-4c57-a3ba-c44de2922279/key+5.png?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/4c0eed77-e512-4c57-a3ba-c44de2922279/key+5.png?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/4c0eed77-e512-4c57-a3ba-c44de2922279/key+5.png?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/4c0eed77-e512-4c57-a3ba-c44de2922279/key+5.png?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/4c0eed77-e512-4c57-a3ba-c44de2922279/key+5.png?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\n            \n          \n        \n          \n        \n\n        \n      \n        </figure>\n      \n\n    \n  \n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n  <p>more than anything, I’ve found an easy trust that the process of “launching” an offering is just another process of discovery in the unknown, of feeling around in the dark. I sense the shape of the thing I don’t know yet. I devote time and space to touching this shape, and listening to what it wants to reveal, to me. </p><p>this marks the beginning of labyrinth. I have no doubt that over the next weeks, months, years, it will grow into a thing I would’ve never predicted, which will only surprise and delight me. that’s the whole point. </p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n    \n  \n    \n\n      \n\n      \n        <figure>\n          \n        \n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n          \n            \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/d8106bc0-4033-4f1d-95fc-8bac4cac89e4/moth2.png?format=1000w\" width=\"3525\" h